<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: Depending on ritual quality, participants will get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days. -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.description>Conforme a qualidade do ritual, os participantes ganham entre {MINMOOD} e {MAXMOOD} de humor por {MOODDAYS} dias.</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.description>
  <!-- EN: chanter present -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>puxador presente</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!-- EN: participant count -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>número de participantes</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!-- EN: room impressiveness -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.2.label>imponência do cômodo</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.comps.2.label>
  <!-- EN: Uninteresting -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>Desinteressante</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was incredibly uninteresting. Yeah, yeah, insects are cool. Bah.\n\nThe ritual had no effect over the insectoid herder's nest building ability. -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>O(a) {0} foi incrivelmente desinteressante. Tá, tá, insetos são legais. Bah.\n\nO ritual não teve efeito na habilidade de construir ninhos do pastor de insetoides.</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!-- EN: Awkward -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>Constrangedora</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was awkward. The speech was repetitive, and it did nothing to convince us of the divinity of our beloved insects.\n\nThe ritual had no effect over the insectoid herder's nest building ability. -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>O(a) {0} foi constrangedor(a). O discurso foi repetitivo e não nos convenceu em nada da divindade dos nossos amados insetos.\n\nO ritual não teve efeito na habilidade de construir ninhos do pastor de insetoides.</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!-- EN: Rousing -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>Empolgante</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was very rousing. The chanter showed impressing skill and the hymn appropriately extolled the virtues of our way of life.\n\nThe ritual refreshed the cooldown of the insectoid herder's nest building ability. -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>O(a) {0} foi muito empolgante. O cantor mostrou uma habilidade impressionante, e o hino exaltou como devia as virtudes do nosso modo de vida.\n\nO ritual zerou a recarga da habilidade de construir ninhos do pastor de insetoides.</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!-- EN: Entrancing -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>Hipnotizante</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was entrancing! We can still hear the mesmerizing words of the hymn, like a myriad insectile legs crawling all over our bodies.\n\nThe ritual refreshed the cooldown of the insectoid herder's nest building ability.\n\nThe ritual also made any insectoids that were assaulting the colony flee. -->
  <VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>O(a) {0} foi hipnotizante! Ainda ouvimos as palavras fascinantes do hino, como incontáveis patinhas de inseto rastejando pelo corpo.\n\nO ritual zerou a recarga da habilidade de construir ninhos do pastor de insetoides.\n\nO ritual também fez fugir os insetoides que atacavam a colônia.</VME_InsectoidHymnRitualOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
</LanguageData>
